<title>POLAND: Zywiec Q3 net falls to PLN 2.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Zywiec Q3 net falls to PLN 2.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zywiec SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Q3 1996	Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating				9.34   vs   16.24</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  7.61   vs   16.95</p>
<p>    net					2.71   vs   10.92</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Zaklady Piwowarskie w Zywcu SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     80.49   vs   62.52</p>
<p>    costs of sales			39.50   vs   31.49</p>
<p>    income tax			     4.90   vs    6.02</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.95   vs    1.89</p>
<p>    financial costs			2.67   vs    0.53</p>
<p>    investment			     5.01   vs   48.05</p>
<p>JANUARY - SEPTEMBER</p>
<p>    operating			     17.79   vs   29.89</p>
<p>    pre-tax				 13.59   vs   36.77</p>
<p>    net					5.83   vs   23.42</p>
<p>    net sales			    197.97   vs  153.04</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     109.71   vs   83.19</p>
<p>    income tax			     7.76   vs   13.35</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.75   vs    8.13</p>
<p>    financial costs			5.95   vs    1.25</p>
<p>    investment			    33.76   vs   83.88</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
